# Density Compare
# Protactinium (Pa) — real density 15.37 g/cm³. equal masses: Protactinium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Protactinium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.0mm color: #00bfff at (-20mm, 4.0mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 122.6 g — the water cube is the reference
